      "message": "\u003e I\u0027d have suggested s/F-Droid/Aurora/ but then I noticed that it\u0027s translated in some languages, so this fine.\n\nI could\u0027ve chosen to do that with languages that still use the word \"F-Droid\" and remove the rest, but one of the reasons it was probably better to just remove it is that that could\u0027ve caused some inconsistencies with gendered languages for example (e.g. in pt-BR, F-Droid is masculine, and Aurora/Aurora Store is feminine).",
